  m_text: "\u25A0 Plan to secure a subject\n\nClassification of experimental subjects:
    Grade C\n\nTarget acquisition method\n\u25A1 an unidentified personnel\n\u25A1
    Civilians to be processed missing\n\u25A1 Private transfer destination\n\u25A1
    Other Approved Subjects\n\nAll subjects are converted to management targets upon
    arrival at the research facility, and contact with the outside world is completely
    blocked until the project is completed.\n\nThe survival of the subject does not
    take precedence over the purpose of the study."
